flowchart TD
    START([Start])
    TRAIN[Starts policy training]
    POLICY[Obtains active task policy]
    EPISODES[Collects completed episodes]
    ELIGIBLE{Enough evidence?}
    EVALUATE[Evaluates outcomes]
    REWARD[Computes rewards]
    LEARN[Updates policy]
    STORE[Stores new policy]
    END([End])

    START --> TRAIN --> POLICY --> EPISODES --> ELIGIBLE
    ELIGIBLE -->|Yes| EVALUATE --> REWARD --> LEARN --> STORE --> END
    ELIGIBLE -->|No| END